  "body": "## What changed\n\nClarifies the Grimoire command surface so the stable human operator interface is the Latin Title Case macro layer, while lowercase power words are internal agent stances and UPPERCASE spell identifiers are procedural implementation labels.\n\n## Why\n\nThis removes ambiguity between human-facing macros, internal stances, and implementation-level spell IDs. It also keeps the public README, Grimoire README, Core spellbook, and AppAI chapter aligned to the same rule.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Synced local `main` to `origin/main` before editing.\n- Ran `git diff --check` and `git diff --cached --check`.\n- Reviewed staged diff for the four intended documentation files only.",
